      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Kuwata&#039;s first hack of Rockman (1). It features new levels, graphics, enemies, and even music. The levels are very challenging; some even have small puzzles in them.\r\n\r\nIt should be noted this hack [b]will not[/b] work with a Mega Man ROM, you need to patch a Rockman ROM."
